{"type":"standard","title":"Byron Donalds","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Byron Donalds</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q59726216","titles":{"canonical":"Byron_Donalds","normalized":"Byron Donalds","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Byron Donalds</span></span>"},"pageid":59364700,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Rep._Byron_Donalds_official_photo%2C_117th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Byron_Donalds_official_photo%2C_117th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Rep._Byron_Donalds_official_photo%2C_117th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1638,"height":2048},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376425633","tid":"8815df04-b7be-11f1-87e2-bb85b8b0ed6b","timestamp":"2026-09-24T02:20:38Z","description":"American politician (born 1978)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byron_Donalds","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byron_Donalds?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byron_Donalds?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Byron_Donalds"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byron_Donalds","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Byron_Donalds","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byron_Donalds?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Byron_Donalds"}},"extract":"Byron Lowell Donalds is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 19th congressional district since 2021. His congressional district includes much of Southwest Florida. From 2016 to 2020, he served in the Florida House of Representatives. A member of the Republican Party, Donalds is its nominee in the 2026 Florida gubernatorial election.","extract_html":"<p><b>Byron Lowell Donalds</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 19th congressional district since 2021. His congressional district includes much of Southwest Florida. From 2016 to 2020, he served in the Florida House of Representatives. A member of the Republican Party, Donalds is its nominee in the 2026 Florida gubernatorial election.</p>"}